{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18815","headline":"詶乐天咏老见示 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶乐天咏老见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人谁不愿老，老去有谁怜。\n身瘦带频减，髪稀冠自偏。\n废书缘惜眼，多炙爲随年。\n经事还谙事，阅人如阅川。\n细思皆幸矣，下此便翛然。\n莫道桑榆晚，微霞尚满天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}